{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB飲食資訊綜藝《美食強人》昨晚（2日）和今晚（3日）播出第11集和12集，主題美食是獲經典電影《食神》upgrade為「黯然銷魂飯」的港式叉燒煎蛋飯，星級食評家為薛家燕和黎諾懿。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:02:59.484512+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:22:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:18:19.957005+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:58:42.527540+00:00","content_hash":"751407a96f09ee9113e61af6d838466ff4e130772dcfa6771dfc76da6bf860b3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}